      "delivery": "Let fear of manipulation harden into Wyck’s methodical case: steady, increasingly exact, and never adolescent or heated.",
      "returnToBaseAfter": true,
      "from": "\"Right.\" Wyck's chin was up. There was a wash of colour across his cheekbones that had nothing to do with the cold. \"Then here it is.",
      "through": "\"So I'm not asking what you are. I've stopped caring what you are. I'm asking what I'm for.\" He shifted his grip on the bar. \"You're building something out of four people, and you haven't asked one of us whether we wanted it built. I'd probably have said yes. That's the thing that's been keeping me up: I'd have said yes on the first morning if you'd asked. You didn't ask, so now I have to.\"",
