      "returnToBaseAfter": true,
      "from": "\"Three. I'm not ready,\" said Rook. \"That's the actual answer, and it's a poor one. It isn't that you can't be trusted with it, and it isn't that you're too young for it — because I was younger than the oldest of you when it started, and nobody asked whether I was too young. I'm not ready to say it out loud. I haven't said it out loud to anybody in — \"",
