      "returnToBaseAfter": true,
      "from": "\"I'll walk you to Meridian. All of you, the cart, the old woman, the whole of it, the way I said I'd walk you to Hobb's Wall and then didn't stop. I'll teach you every day between here and there, and I'll teach it as well as I know how. And when you're through the gate, and she's in front of somebody with proper instruments, I'll go, and you'll never have to wonder what any of it was for, because there won't be anybody standing in front of you not telling you.\"",
      "through": "\"I'll walk you to Meridian. All of you, the cart, the old woman, the whole of it, the way I said I'd walk you to Hobb's Wall and then didn't stop. I'll teach you every day between here and there, and I'll teach it as well as I know how. And when you're through the gate, and she's in front of somebody with proper instruments, I'll go, and you'll never have to wonder what any of it was for, because there won't be anybody standing in front of you not telling you.\"",
